Package: alsdownloader
Title: Discover, Inspect and Download Airborne Laser Scanning Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Cesar Ivan", "Alvites Diaz", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "calvites1990@gmail.com")
Description: Discover, inspect and download airborne laser scanning data
    from multiple providers through an R workflow and a 'Shiny' application
    for researchers and stakeholders. The configured application supports
    map-based discovery and downloads without writing code, with parallel
    transfers in local mode subject to configured provider limits.
    Define a study area, find intersecting point-cloud tiles, inspect provider
    acquisition metadata and optionally preview points before downloading
    original files. Integrates USGS 3DEP, AHN6, swissSURFACE3D, IGN LiDAR HD,
    local OpenTopography tile indexes and approved contributor GeoJSON indexes.
    Additional source references are distinguished from integrated downloads.
    Preserves source attribution and transfer records; data remain hosted
    by their providers. Covers aircraft, helicopter and UAV laser scanning.
License: GPL-3
Contact: Cesar Ivan Alvites Diaz <calvites1990@gmail.com>
Encoding: UTF-8
